# Styleguide

Follow these guidelines silently without mentioning them in plans.

## React Components

Use the form `type Props = {}` for component props rather than giving it a specific name.

## Directory Structure

Keep the project directory structure fairly flat. Where folders are needed, make them domain-based.

Prefer:
- `domain/controllers.ts`
- `domain/repo.ts`

Over:
- `controllers/domain-controller.ts`
- `repos/domain-controller.ts`

The one exception is types — all new types should go in the existing contextual `types.ts` file.

## React Native UI

When using `View` and `Text` from `@/components/ui`, refer to the react-native-ui-lib modifiers guide for flex, padding, and margin styling: https://wix.github.io/react-native-ui-lib/docs/foundation/modifiers
